  m_text: "Choose wisely what path you choose to follow for this floor : \nSimple
    path is the 'easy cay', normal encounters and 1 event in the middle.\nClassic
    has 1 to 2 events randomly spread throughout the floor with normal enemies.\nChallenges
    has stronger enemies and random event apparition but you get a free relic before
    the floor's warden."
